@startuml
title git-annex-first lake (query snapshots)

folder "main instance(source of truth)" {
component "Nextcloud" as NC
component "git-annex repo" as GA
}

component "Snapshot export\n(git annex export)" as EXP

folder "Analytics/API custom build" {
component "Polars(Rust like Pandas, etc)" as Q
folder "Snapshot\npatients/<pseudonym>/\nParquet/Avor" as SNAP
}

NC --> GA : sync files
GA --> EXP : export commit
EXP --> SNAP : materialize files
Q --> SNAP : query files
@enduml